OL,3,GNEWSALittle tern colony has worst
OL,4,Abreeding season
OL,5,
OL,6,FA little tern colony has experienced
OL,7,Fits toughest breeding season since
OL,8,Festablishing themselves at a site.
OL,10,FSince 2019 the seabirds have travelled
OL,11,Fabout 3,000 miles (4,828km) from West
OL,12,FAfrica to Seaton Carew, near
OL,13,FHartlepool.
OL,15,FBut this year the colony's 83 nesting
OL,16,Fpairs produced just 17 fledglings,
OL,17,Fcompared to 67 in 2025.
OL,19,FTees Valley Wildlife Trust said
OL,20,Fflooding and damage to the colony's
OL,21,Fperimeter fence contributed to
OL,22,Fdifficult conditions for the birds.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
